OL,3,GNEWSAFilm studios given green light for
OL,4,Aexpansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major film studio next to the M4 has
OL,7,Fsecured planning permission to expand
OL,8,Fits operations onto neighbouring
OL,9,Ffarmland.
OL,11,FWokingham Borough Council has approved
OL,12,Fplans to use land south of Oldhouse
OL,13,FFarm in Shinfield, near Reading, as an
OL,14,Foutdoor filming site for five years.
OL,16,FKnown as Backlot 3, the land will
OL,17,Fprovide extra space for outdoor filming
OL,18,Fand set-building for productions based
OL,19,Fat nearby Shinfield Studios.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
